  "chitchat": [
    "\"Clean it, check it, know it. A tool you don't understand will get you killed.\"",
    "\"No smart gear on my shelves. Nothing here has ever once phoned home.\"",
    "\"You draw what you've earned. That's not meanness, it's arithmetic.\"",
    "\"Iron sights. No battery to die, no chip to spoof. Learn them and you'll never be blind.\""
  ],
  "description": "A compact, unhurried woman with reading glasses on a cord and a whetstone never far from her hand. Behind her the shelves run in graded rows, every item cleaned and logged in a hand-kept ledger. She fits gear to people the way a good tailor fits a suit — a long look, a short question, and she knows what you should carry.",
  "dialogue_tree": {
    "bye": {
      "options": [],
      "text": "\"Keep it clean.\" She's already back to her ledger."
    },
    "creed": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Show me the shelves.",
          "next": "__shop__"
        },
        {
          "label": "Back.",
          "next": "root"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Everything here works without the grid, without an augment, without a wire to the machine. That's the whole idea.\" She taps a rifle's iron sights. \"The chromed will tell you flesh and steel is obsolete. Then a storm rolls through, their fancy optics die, and it's us still standing, still shooting straight over plain iron. Master the simple thing and nothing can take it from you.\""
    },
    "root": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What's the philosophy of the shelf?",
          "next": "creed"
        },
        {
          "label": "Let me see what I can draw.",
          "next": "__shop__"
        },
        {
          "label": "Nothing today.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "She looks up, marks her place in the ledger with one finger. \"So they let you in. Good for you.\" A measuring glance, head to boots. \"I'm the quartermaster. What the Watch trusts you with depends on what you've done for the Watch — but you're inside the door, so let's see what fits.\""
    }
  },
